## Predictions (written before the run)
- units dominate (pathing + AI per unit): t/s falls with citizens and wild units; citizens cost more each (jobs, needs)
- open caverns cost through pathing: cav3 slower than base once dwarves and creatures use the shaft; little in 6,000 ticks if nobody walks it
- map area costs (temperature, water, plants): e6 slower than e4 slower than e2 at equal citizens
- the heavy fort approaches the user's 30: H_heavy well under A_boats; 30 t/s would need more than +500 wild/+60 citizens

